      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The town officially incorporated in 1890, cementing its status as a historic Colorado community.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        25
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.uncovercolorado.com/towns/green-mountain-falls/",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Gazebo Lake, the town’s centerpiece, offers peaceful walks and a gazebo that invites locals to relax by the water.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        20,
        30
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.uncovercolorado.com/towns/green-mountain-falls/",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Historic Church in the Wildwood and Lake Gazebo were restored in 2008, preserving Green Mountain Falls’ architectural heritage.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        27
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.uncovercolorado.com/towns/green-mountain-falls/",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
